<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2333" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰθοψ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οπος</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰθός, ὄψ</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fiery-looking</i>, in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> as epith. of metal, <i>flashing</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴθοπι χαλκῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					4.495
				</span></i>
			, etc.; and of wine, <i>sparkling</i> (or '<i>fiery</i>',
			cf. Epigr. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Dips.</u>
				6
			</span></i>), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴθοπα οἶνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					4.259
				</span></i>
			, etc.; once of smoke, <i>mixed with flame</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴθαλος</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				10.152
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἶ. φλογμός, λαμπάς,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				1019
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ba.</u>
				594
			</span></i> (both lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>black</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				1.133
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴθοπι κισσῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>App.Anth.</u>
					3.166
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Procl.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>fiery, keen,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					363
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῶμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Tim.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					223
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίψη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					15.7
				</span></i>
			; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βα-</span></b> 
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκανίη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					5.217
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
